		(descr "Sub-miniature centre-sprung (ON)-OFF-(ON) DPDT toggle, PC pins, lever along y (D-492 window switch, P155). Origin = the bushing's centre. Pole 1 in the column x -2.54, pole 2 at x +2.54; in each column DN (y -2.54), COM (y 0), UP (y +2.54): the lever pushed up closes COM to the terminal on the far side (UP, at +y). A generic 0.1 in grid with poles 0.2 in apart - NOT read from a part's drawing: confirm pin pitch, pole spacing, body and bushing against the switch bought (P155) before ordering. No 3D model.")
